                        <span class="inline-flex items-center"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blip-emerald mr-1.5"></span>Calibram sizing: <strong id="count-sizing" class="ml-1">4</strong></span>
                        <span class="inline-flex items-center"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blip-navy/30 mr-1.5"></span>Descartados: <strong id="count-discard" class="ml-1">0</strong></span>
                    </div>
                    <button onclick="copySessionSummary()" class="w-full sm:w-auto inline-flex justify-center items-center px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold text-white bg-blip-blue hover:bg-blip-navy transition cursor-pointer">
                        Copiar tudo (notas e checklist)
